    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Director and cinematographer (DP) who also edits and shoots stills; based between the North Shore of Oahu and Los Angeles. Known for surf films with pro surfer Noah Beschen (NOAH, Red Bull TV 2023) and the Vimeo Staff Pick spec spot MAYHEM for Lost Surfboards; brand work for PUMA x Hello Sunrise, Reef, Outerknown, GoPro and Tenore. Represented for commercials by Statement Content (LA). Seniority: mid-level, roughly 5 to 6 years filming since graduating Montana State (marketing + photography) around 2020; self-taught, now moving into commercials and music videos. Autonomy 3: directs, shoots and grades his own spots end to end, but mostly at small-crew scale so far (inferred from credits, no first-hand evidence). Freelance: own site, LinkedIn (owner, Andy Woodward Photography) and the Statement Content roster agree. James Morrins (worked with you at Fuse) recommended him per your clip note. Not to be confused with a Milwaukee editor of the same name; this is @andywoodward, matched via his site and IG bio.",
